Next are steps of risk assessment, i.e. if you are doing risk assessment of any activity then what steps will you follow?

170
00:08:00,130 --> 00:08:03,130
So here the steps are given, there are total 5 steps.

171
00:08:03,130 --> 00:08:11,130
First identify the hazard, decide who might be harm and how, evaluate the risk and take action, record your finding and review.

172
00:08:12,130 --> 00:08:21,130
So first identify the hazard, so first you have to identify the hazard, i.e. whatever task you are doing, whatever job you are doing on your side, what are the hazards?

173
00:08:21,130 --> 00:08:23,130
First you have to find out this.

174
00:08:23,130 --> 00:08:26,130
Next you have to decide who might be harm and how.

175
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:33,130
You have to decide that whoever you have found the hazard, whoever you have found the hazard, who are you going to harm and how are you going to harm.

176
00:08:33,130 --> 00:08:41,130
Suppose if your work at height is going on then any tool or equipment can fall from height then it is a hazard.

177
00:08:41,130 --> 00:08:43,130
So who are you going to harm and who are you going to harm?

178
00:08:43,130 --> 00:08:48,130
So whoever workers are working on the ground level and who are you going to harm and how are you going to harm them?

179
00:08:48,130 --> 00:08:51,130
So you have to decide all these things.

180
00:08:51,130 --> 00:08:54,130
Third step is evaluate the risk and take action.

181
00:08:54,130 --> 00:09:04,130
You have to identify the hazard and decide how much risk you are going to take and how you are going to take action.

182
00:09:04,130 --> 00:09:07,130
Fourth step is to record your findings.

183
00:09:07,130 --> 00:09:18,130
In the fourth step you have to write down all the findings that you have identified and taken action to control your risk.

184
00:09:18,130 --> 00:09:20,130
Fifth is to review.

185
00:09:20,130 --> 00:09:32,130
At the end you have to review it all the time so that if there is a change in the work, a new equipment or a change in the worker or a change in the scope of the work then some hazards can be included.

186
00:09:32,130 --> 00:09:37,130
Some risks can be included so you have to check it and review it and update it.

